{"item_uid": "指考100-history-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "二二八事件之後，國民政府派國防部長來臺處理善後事宜，宣布多項措施以挽\n回民心，下列何者為其重要措施之一？", "options": {"A": "為儘早回歸政治常態，將長官公署制改為省政府制", "B": "為消弭民怨，取消菸酒專賣制度，民間可自由買賣", "C": "實施民主，縣市長改為民選，並隨即舉行地方選舉", "D": "為落實言論自由，准許民眾組黨及創辦報刊、雜誌"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 70.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 88.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 47.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 70.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 84.0, 76.0, 63.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1950年，一位美國總統在國會報告最新的東亞情勢說：「共產主義者在韓國所\n作所為，就如希特勒、墨索里尼和日本在10年、15年和20年前所做的一樣。我\n敢肯定，假如讓南韓淪陷，共產黨的領袖便會變本加厲，進而攻擊我們鄰近的\n國家。」這位總統在演講之後隨即採取了哪一種亞洲政策？", "options": {"A": "視共產中國為大國而採取強硬的圍堵政策", "B": "不待聯合國的安理會表決即斷然出兵南韓", "C": "援助並借重臺灣國民黨軍隊協助南韓反攻", "D": "為避免骨牌效應而開始軍援南越對抗共黨"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 28.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 26.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 43.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 15.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 38.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 28.0, "p_high": 43.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [49.0, 31.0, 23.0, 18.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "兩漢期間山東的鄒、魯兩地流行一句俗諺：「遺子黃金滿籯，不如一經。」這\n裡的「經」指的是哪一類圖書文獻？", "options": {"A": "醫卜曆算", "B": "讖緯圖籙", "C": "諸子百家", "D": "詩書易禮"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 58.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 74.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 45.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 58.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [81.0, 64.0, 54.0, 47.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某位詩人感嘆：「奴隸生涯抱恨多，橫暴蠻威奈若何」，希望同胞不要做「賤民」，\n想號召「六百萬民齊崛起，誓將熱血為義死」，以期「同心來復舊山河」。這位\n詩人感嘆的背景為何？", "options": {"A": "荷蘭統治臺灣時期，漢人對荷蘭苛政不滿", "B": "鄭成功欲將臺灣作為「反清復明」的基地", "C": "康熙時因政府高壓手段而引發朱一貴事件", "D": "日本治臺時期，臺人不滿日本的差別待遇"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 53.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 70.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 38.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 53.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 60.0, 51.0, 43.0, 36.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "西印度群島和中南美洲是最早淪為西班牙殖民地的地方，當地的印地安人也首\n先成為被奴役殘殺的對象，但是到了19世紀上半葉，有些拉丁美洲國家已能擺\n脫西班牙統治而獲得獨立，其主要原因為何？", "options": {"A": "中南美洲的國家推行工業化之後國力隨之大增", "B": "西班牙與英國因海戰失利無暇顧及海外殖民地", "C": "美國發表門羅宣言後歐洲國家不再聲援西班牙", "D": "美西戰爭瓦解了西班牙在中南美洲的殖民勢力"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 19.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 28.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 44.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 55.0, 41.0, 27.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某地，地主將耕地劃分為三大區塊，或春耕，或秋耕，或休耕；為了恢復地力，\n休耕的土地種植豆科植物等綠肥。農家使用地主提供的農具與牲口，共同耕\n作。村莊另有許多共同的設施，如馬廄、作坊、烤坊、牧場、林地及宗教場所。\n這種生活方式最可能出現在何時何地？", "options": {"A": "四世紀的埃及", "B": "七世紀的希臘", "C": "十三世紀法蘭西", "D": "十五世紀的華北"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 97.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 70.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 70.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 95.0, 92.0, 87.0, 60.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一本新出版的書介紹當時歐洲各國的政治與體制，書中指出：俄羅斯、法蘭西、\n普魯士等國盛行君主專制；荷蘭及西班牙已無法維持海上霸權；而英國因開風氣\n之先，實施君主立憲制度，君主與國會共治，國勢蒸蒸日上。這本書出版於何時？", "options": {"A": "十六世紀初", "B": "十八世紀末", "C": "十九世紀末", "D": "二十世紀初\n- 1 -\n100年指考 第 2 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 70.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 85.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 54.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 70.0, "p_high": 85.0, "p_low": 54.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 79.0, 71.0, 63.0, 48.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "韓愈的〈師說〉一文指出：「師者，所以傳道、授業、解惑也」，強調學習過程\n中老師扮演重要角色。但文中也反映了唐代以來，學子學習過程中不重師道的\n現象。這種現象與下列何者關係最為密切？", "options": {"A": "唐行科舉，以文取士，強調創作，不再依賴經師傳授", "B": "隋唐帝國雜染胡人風俗，不重視學術，師道因之不彰", "C": "佛學傳入中國，主張眾生平等，學生因而不重視師道", "D": "唐代經濟繁榮，人們多追逐利益，師道尊嚴因而不顯"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 47.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 31.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 63.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 34.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 36.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 63.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [69.0, 51.0, 42.0, 38.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1840年代末期，荷蘭某學院圖書館發現了《福爾摩沙語彙》（Woordenlijst der\nFormosaansche taal）一書。這是17世紀荷蘭來臺傳教士使用的語言用書，他\n們用這種語言來從事教育、宣道和主持禮拜。此「福爾摩沙語」是指：", "options": {"A": "古荷蘭語", "B": "閩南方言", "C": "北京官話", "D": "西拉雅語"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 14.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 79.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 93.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 25.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 60.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 79.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 60.0, "discrimination": 33.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 89.0, 85.0, 76.0, 50.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "十八世紀末漳州人林某欲前往臺灣謀生時，四處打聽臺灣情況，但說法不一，\n下列何種說法較符合當時實情？", "options": {"A": "荷蘭商人在鹿港設立許多商行，經營鹿皮生意，需要人工，就業容易", "B": "臺南安平一帶有許多西方傳教士及外商，商業活絡，但民教衝突頻傳", "C": "朝廷正式在臺北設府，計畫開發瑠公圳，農業前景可期，有發展潛力", "D": "漳州人吳沙召募大量同鄉，前往噶瑪蘭地區開墾荒地，較有謀生機會"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 51.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 76.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 28.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 76.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [83.0, 62.0, 48.0, 36.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有位外交官參加一次國際和會，原本期望大會能對戰費、領土等議題作出公正\n明智的處置，但會中的決議卻令他失望。他表示：許多代表運用詭辯來掩飾他\n們的報復行為；強索巨額賠款；又屈從於強權，不能公正處理領土問題。這位\n外交官批評的是：", "options": {"A": "維也納會議中，戰勝國對拿破崙的安排", "B": "凡爾賽和約中，協約國對同盟國的處置", "C": "慕尼黑會議期間，希特勒對捷克的脅迫", "D": "九一八事變後，國際聯盟對事件的處理"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 81.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 97.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 60.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 87.0, 77.0, 50.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "近代以前，一國政府為打擊敵人，往往發給船主特許狀，鼓勵本國商船掠奪敵\n方船隻，攻擊敵方港口。英格蘭女王伊莉莎白一世便曾經同意英格蘭海船掠奪\n加勒比海和中南美洲沿岸城市，引起敵方報復，發生激戰。英格蘭船隻攻擊的\n主要對象是哪個國家？", "options": {"A": "西班牙", "B": "法蘭西", "C": "俄羅斯", "D": "荷蘭"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 83.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 93.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 70.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 83.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 70.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 91.0, 88.0, 81.0, 63.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "清代中期，臺灣漢人為獲得某種經濟利益，必須深入山區，經常引發與原住民\n的衝突。此種經濟利益主要是指：", "options": {"A": "煤礦，漢人採煤經常破壞風水，侵擾原住民的祖靈", "B": "樟腦，漢人入山砍伐樟木，破壞原住民的居住環境", "C": "茶葉，種植茶樹的緯度愈來愈高，引起原住民不滿", "D": "稻米，水稻需大量用水，漢人入山引水，引發衝突"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 84.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 74.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 89.0, 85.0, 80.0, 70.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "民國16年（1927），時任南京國民政府代理主席並主持國民黨中央黨部的胡漢\n民曾說：「倘若中央黨部和國民政府沒有在南京行使職權，從4月起大家就要完\n全受共產黨的支配，可以說不但大江南北的各省不得了，就連珠江流域也通通\n要受兩湖以往所受的赤禍了。」胡漢民所說的「行使職權」是指什麼？", "options": {"A": "搜查俄國使館，驅逐俄國顧問", "B": "發動剿共戰爭，迫使共黨逃亡", "C": "揭發共黨陰謀，進行清黨運動", "D": "繼續二次北伐，完成全國統一"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 61.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 82.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 21.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 72.0, 61.0, 48.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一位皇帝登基後，立志恢復古羅馬帝國的版圖，他先派軍征服北非，再回師進\n攻義大利，經過長久的戰爭，幾乎收復西南歐地區。但因軍費支出龐大，難以\n維持，所以這位皇帝去世後，新征服的土地又落入日耳曼人之手。這位皇帝是：", "options": {"A": "資料一為歷史事實，資料二則是歷史解釋", "B": "資料一為歷史解釋，資料二則是歷史事實", "C": "學者引用相同史料，可能獲得不同的結論", "D": "兩者引用相同史料，結論不同，當有一誤"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 16.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 29.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 55.0, 41.0, 34.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一位住在上海的西方傳教士寫信給教廷，報告在華工作內容。他提到：最近中\n國與日本發生衝突，戰事發生之前，上海的外文報紙都認為中國一定能夠打敗\n日本，沒想到日軍卻打了勝仗。這場戰爭是：", "options": {"A": "甲午戰爭", "B": "瀋陽事變", "C": "淞滬之役", "D": "七七事變"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 82.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 94.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 68.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 82.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 68.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 91.0, 85.0, 77.0, 63.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "法、俄兩國宗教信仰不同，政治主張不同，拿破崙戰爭時期，法國甚至入侵俄\n國。到了十九世紀末，兩國卻締結了同盟。他們合作的原因為何？", "options": {"A": "工業革命後，英國勢力擴張，法俄聯合抵制", "B": "德意志統一，破壞原有均勢，法俄合作抗衡", "C": "義大利統一，影響法俄兩國在地中海的利益", "D": "土耳其復興，危及法俄兩國在巴爾幹的優勢"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 70.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 87.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 51.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 70.0, "p_high": 87.0, "p_low": 51.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 80.0, 71.0, 62.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "學校牆上掛著一幅書法作品，寫著「為天地立心，為生民立命，為往聖繼絕學，\n為萬世開太平。」老師說：這幾句話的內容反映了宋代學者的抱負。老師判斷\n的依據最主要是：", "options": {"A": "為天地立心，說明宋代學者以人為主體解釋天理", "B": "為生民立命，說明宋代庶民崛起，受到政府重視", "C": "為往聖繼絕學，說明宋代印刷術發達，書籍流通", "D": "為萬世開太平，說明澶淵之盟後，宋遼關係穩定"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 32.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 15.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 48.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 30.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 25.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 48.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [54.0, 38.0, 30.0, 23.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖(一)是臺灣某一事項統計的變遷示意圖，這個統計的內容應當是：", "options": {"A": "軍費，單位臺幣\n數數數數量量量量(百百百百萬萬萬萬) 年年年年成成成成長長長長率率率率(%) 數量(萬擔) 種植面積(萬畝)", "B": "外匯，單位美元 26\n24", "C": "人口，單位為人 22 產量", "D": "電話，單位為具 20 種植面積\n18\n16 4.0\n3.5\n14 年年年年成成成成長長長長率率率率\n3.0\n12 2.5\n10\n2.0\n8 1.5\n6 數數數數量量量量 1.0\n4\n2\n0\n1900 10 20 30 40 50 60 70 80 90 2000 年代\n圖(一) 圖(二)"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 52.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [83.0, 70.0, 63.0, 57.0, 49.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖(二)是近代中國某一經濟作物的生產統計示意圖，該經濟作物是指下列哪一項？", "options": {"A": "菸草", "B": "甘蔗", "C": "罌粟", "D": "棉花\n- 3 -\n100年指考 第 4 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 28.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 27.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 26.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 27.0, "p_high": 39.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [44.0, 29.0, 24.0, 21.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "司馬談嘗論諸子百家，認為諸子百家學說雖然不同，但「天下一致而百慮，同\n歸而殊途」，其所謂「一致」、「同歸」，所指為何？", "options": {"A": "治國安邦方案", "B": "天人合一思想", "C": "追求國富兵強", "D": "具大一統觀念"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 54.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 28.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 73.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 17.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 33.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 39.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 54.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 66.0, 57.0, 46.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "表(一)是臺灣1960至1970年間，各項產業佔國內生產淨值的比重表，表中的數\n字變化，說明了臺灣經濟發展的哪一項事實？\n表(一) 單位：%\n年度 農業 工業 服務業 合計\n1960 28.5 26.9 44.6 100\n1965 23.6 30.2 46.2 100\n1970 15.5 36.8 47.7 100", "options": {"A": "朝野運用外資發展加工出口業已明顯見效", "B": "十大建設已成功扮演了工業發展的火車頭", "C": "經濟自由化制度化和國際化的政策已奏效", "D": "發展小而美的高科技產業已發揮相當效果"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 45.0, "B": 45.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 70.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 59.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 45.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 56.0, 43.0, 32.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖(三)是中國大陸一幅描述人民經濟生活的漫畫，圖中的\n文字是「歡迎選購」，這是哪一個時代的經濟生活？", "options": {"A": "1950年代中", "B": "1960年代末", "C": "1970年代初", "D": "1980年代初 圖(三)"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 50.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 11.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 74.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 64.0, 50.0, 35.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "相較於基督教與佛教，儒家在中國既無教堂也無廟宇，但兩千年來，其學說不\n僅居中國學術思想的正統地位，而且深入基層，成為維繫世道人心的社會規\n範，其主要原因為何？", "options": {"A": "儒家的經典，是歷代教育及選任人才的重要依據", "B": "全國各地普設孔廟，並由官方定期舉辦祭孔典禮", "C": "儒家思想集諸子百家大成，深獲帝王愛好與提倡", "D": "通俗戲劇小說，將儒家忠孝節義觀念普及於庶民"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 57.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 27.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 66.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 27.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 46.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 57.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 46.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [68.0, 63.0, 59.0, 53.0, 42.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "二十世紀「六○」年代是個激情和叛逆的年代，其時間大約是指1963至1973\n年之間。這與我們通常將1961年到1970這十年視為「六○年代」的作法不同，\n我們如何正確理解這種分期方法？", "options": {"A": "世界各國有關歷史的分期都有公認的標準，不可任意調整", "B": "各國分期方法不同，雖求同存異而年代終始計算仍有歧異", "C": "史家因主題而設定分期標準，故各種分期都有其學理根據", "D": "20世紀各國曆法尚未統一，史家採用不同計年而出現差異"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 81.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 63.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 63.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 92.0, 87.0, 79.0, 53.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一位近代地理學家在綜論四川人口地理結構時說：「雖然清代以前的本地人後\n裔還能在西南及西部少數地方找到，但相對來說數量很少。四川東部、西部和\n南部以湖廣籍為主，河南、安徽和江蘇籍，主要在南部各縣，相當多的陝西、\n甘肅籍在北部和西部某些縣份，廣東、福建、江蘇和浙江籍則主要住在成都和\n重慶等大城市。」這種人口地理結構的形成，主要的因素是：", "options": {"A": "從順治到道光年間，各省過剩人口不斷移入四川", "B": "太平天國之亂時，江南各省難民紛紛避亂到四川", "C": "國軍剿共期間，各地的農民隨紅軍長征播遷四川", "D": "八年抗戰期間，淪陷區的各省軍民大量湧入四川"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 24.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 31.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 43.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 35.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 24.0, "p_high": 43.0, "p_low": 11.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [50.0, 30.0, 19.0, 13.0, 10.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "唐初佛教宗派林立，教義殊方，受中國影響的韓國、日本亦同。其後中國與日\n本、韓國的佛教各宗派漸至消沉，應時而興的是禪宗和淨土宗。這種現象反映\n了東亞佛教信仰變遷的哪一種特徵？", "options": {"A": "佛教思想漸統於一尊", "B": "由形而上走向世俗化", "C": "儒釋道三教漸趨融合", "D": "統一政權的思想控制\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 100年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 35.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 11.0, "B": 59.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 49.0, "p_high": 59.0, "p_low": 39.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 53.0, 50.0, 45.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "曾國荃曾奏稱：「近年以來，印度、日本產茶日旺，售價較輕，西商皆爭購洋\n茶，以致華商連連折損。據皖南茶商估計，光緒十一、十二兩年，虧本自三四\n成至五六成不等；十三年虧損尤甚，統計虧銀將及百萬兩，不獨商販受累，即\n皖南山戶茶農亦因之交困。」造成上述情況的主要原因為何？", "options": {"A": "外商在中國口岸設加工廠", "B": "中國未納入世界經濟體系", "C": "外人長期掌控海關稅務司", "D": "列強商業資本主義的擴張"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 29.0, "D": 50.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 62.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 35.0, "D": 36.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 62.0, "p_low": 36.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [64.0, 57.0, 51.0, 45.0, 31.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某學者讚揚歷史上的一項技術，認為該技術的出現，推動了西方的文藝復興運\n動、啟蒙運動等歷史發展，稱得上是重大的「革命」。這位學者讚揚的是哪一\n項技術？", "options": {"A": "煉金術", "B": "觀星術", "C": "航海技術", "D": "活字版印刷"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 91.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 99.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 78.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 91.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 78.0, "discrimination": 21.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 99.0, 97.0, 91.0, 70.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "表(二)是1500~1800年間四個地區的一 表(二)\n項統計，這個統計的項目最可能是： 年代 1500 1600 1700 1800", "options": {"A": "紡織品生產總值 歐洲 68 83 106 173", "B": "白銀的貯存總量 中國 100 150 150 315", "C": "罌粟的產量統計 印度 79 100 200 190\n非洲 85 95 100 100", "D": "穀類作物生產量"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 24.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 19.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 22.0, "B": 52.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 28.0, "B": 41.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 49.0, "p_high": 52.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 11.0, "p_quintiles": [52.0, 52.0, 53.0, 51.0, 36.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "臺灣在威權統治時期，政府對社會各層面都扮演領導和監督的角色。但威權統治並\n非密不透風，其間也有幾項有利於民主轉型的因素。這些有利的因素包括哪幾項？", "options": {"A": "定期舉行的選舉制度，使政治上的反對勢力有發展的空間", "B": "出版講學等文化政策開放，有效潛移默化國民的民主意識", "C": "中產階級和資本家隨經濟發展崛起，為政治轉型提供活力", "D": "外省人長期掌權，反使省籍問題成為民主運動的動員基礎", "E": "推動多元平等的社會政策，使族群關係得以長期維持和諧"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ACD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 53.0, "B": 41.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 63.0, "E": 35.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 56.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 97.0, "D": 77.0, "E": 20.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 55.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 76.0, "D": 45.0, "E": 52.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 41.0, "p_high": 59.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [63.0, 51.0, 42.0, 31.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-032", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 33, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "民國八十年，政府順應學運訴求，終止「動員戡亂時期」，並廢止「動員勘亂\n時期臨時條款」，此舉對臺灣民主政治的發展，帶來哪些突破性的進展？", "options": {"A": "總統的權力和任期受到憲法約束", "B": "依法定期舉辦正、副總統的選舉", "C": "依法定期舉辦中央民意代表選舉", "D": "依法定期舉辦地方行政首長選舉", "E": "依法定期舉辦地方民意代表選舉"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ACA", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 87.0, "B": 77.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 53.0, "E": 44.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 96.0, "B": 78.0, "C": 76.0, "D": 40.0, "E": 27.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 76.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 56.0, "D": 63.0, "E": 59.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 44.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 21.0, "p_quintiles": [48.0, 36.0, 30.0, 25.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-033", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 34, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1971年，日本政府發表的《經濟白皮書》中，難掩得意的表示：「回首往事，\n風雨25年，完成戰後復興的日本經濟，在技術革新和振興出口兩隻車輪驅動\n下，正朝著先進國的道路邁進。」但中外許多學者認為，在戰後「風雨25年」\n中，日本經濟的機遇與挑戰並存，且機遇大於挑戰。從戰後的國際情勢來看，\n學者所謂的「機遇」應該是指：", "options": {"A": "在美蘇對立加劇下，美國急需日本產業技術協助重建歐洲", "B": "在中韓相繼赤化下，反共陣營的日本倖免戰後的賠償責任", "C": "在兩大陣營對抗下，美國扶植日本為對抗共產勢力的盟友", "D": "在國際冷戰氛圍下，日本幸運成為馬歇爾計畫的援助國家", "E": "在共產勢力擴張下，韓戰越戰的軍需景氣強化了日本出口\n- 5 -\n100年指考 第 6 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "CE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 32.0, "B": 51.0, "C": 87.0, "D": 36.0, "E": 81.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 20.0, "B": 57.0, "C": 98.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 93.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 43.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 72.0, "D": 54.0, "E": 67.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 45.0, "p_high": 60.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [63.0, 54.0, 46.0, 37.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-034", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 35, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "根據道教的信仰傳統，城隍與土地公位階不同、職司有別。城隍被視為玉皇大\n帝管理下界蒼生的代表，祂有哪一項土地公所沒有的職權？", "options": {"A": "安胎順產", "B": "貧富貴賤", "C": "陰間審判", "D": "消災解厄"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "35-36", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 88.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 78.0, "discrimination": 16.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 93.0, 91.0, 87.0, 73.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-history-035", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 36, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "就道教的發展而言，自元明清以降，造成道教日益世俗化，並且成為中國、臺\n灣等地華人社會俗文化重要內涵的主要理論與實踐方法是什麼？", "options": {"A": "鬼神信仰、儀式法術的社會活動", "B": "自然恬淡、少私寡欲的生活哲學", "C": "清淨虛明、無思無慮的靈修方法", "D": "神清氣朗、健康長壽的醫療養生"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "35-36", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 72.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 86.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 57.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 57.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 81.0, 73.0, 67.0, 51.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
